[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000]   Previously on Six.
[00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000]   The United States has been fighting a war against terror for 15 years.
[00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000]   SEAL Team Six, the member of Special Operations forces have been deployed for 5,400 days.
[00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000]   It is the longest war in American history.
[00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000]   Terror attacks all over the world are an all-time high.
[00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000]   [explosion]
[00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.000]   We talked you did this.
[00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000]   He's hiding in a village in Canar.
[00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000]   The command wants us to take a shot tonight.
[00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.000]   Take this up.
[00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.000]   Goddamn 70s.
[00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000]   Wait! Wait! I'm there again!
[00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.000]   I want to go home.
[00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.000]   No!
