[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000]   - Previously on "Six."
[00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000]   Mm.
[00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000]   It's time for you to get back in the saddle.
[00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000]   - 'Cause you know lean hands.
[00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000]   - Shorts.
[00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000]   - I need a gun to protect the kids.
[00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000]   - We're safe, Juanita.
[00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.000]   - Tell that to rip.
[00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000]   - I just want to sit for a bit.
[00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000]   - You shot that man?
[00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000]   - [screams]
[00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000]   - If you guys want a shot at the guy behind Rip's murder,
