[00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:30.240]   Send for him.
[00:39:30.240 --> 00:39:33.240]   We'll wait.
[00:39:33.240 --> 00:39:38.240]   ♪
[00:39:38.240 --> 00:39:40.240]   You're here to kill us.
[00:39:40.240 --> 00:39:47.240]   The only reason you're still alive is because your prince here is incompetent.
[00:39:47.240 --> 00:39:50.240]   ♪
[00:39:50.240 --> 00:39:52.240]   Who's my car to play?
[00:39:52.240 --> 00:39:53.240]   No longer.
[00:39:53.240 --> 00:39:57.240]   He will be returned to the United States as a peace offering.
[00:39:57.240 --> 00:39:59.240]   One president to another.
[00:39:59.240 --> 00:40:01.240]   In exchange for what?
[00:40:01.240 --> 00:40:03.240]   Credit.
[00:40:03.240 --> 00:40:05.240]   Trust.
[00:40:05.240 --> 00:40:07.240]   Both of which you've lost.
[00:40:07.240 --> 00:40:10.240]   Send for him now.
[00:40:10.240 --> 00:40:12.240]   He's here.
[00:40:12.240 --> 00:40:15.240]   Don't listen to the info, though.
[00:40:15.240 --> 00:40:17.240]   I'll take it on.
[00:40:17.240 --> 00:40:20.240]   In this name, Michael.
[00:40:20.240 --> 00:40:22.240]   ♪
[00:40:22.240 --> 00:40:23.240]   I will kill you.
[00:40:23.240 --> 00:40:25.240]   You traitor.
[00:40:25.240 --> 00:40:30.240]   Michael! Michael!
[00:40:30.240 --> 00:40:35.240]   [dramatic music]
[00:40:35.240 --> 00:40:38.240]   [dramatic music]
[00:40:38.240 --> 00:40:40.240]   No, no, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
[00:40:40.240 --> 00:40:43.240]   [dramatic music]
[00:40:43.240 --> 00:40:46.240]   [dramatic music]
[00:40:46.240 --> 00:40:49.240]   [dramatic music]
[00:40:49.240 --> 00:40:52.240]   What the hell was that shot up?
